<title>BELGIUM: EU says clears ITM buy of Spar Handels.</title>
<headline>EU says clears ITM buy of Spar Handels.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission cleared on Tuesday the proposed takeover of the German company Spar Handels AG distribution chain by ITM Entreprises, a unit of French retail group Intermarche, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;In the event, there is no danger of the creation or the strengthening of a dominant position, neither in terms of additional market share nor from increased purchasing power,&quot; the Commission statement said.</p>
<p>The ITM group, which is one of France's two leading distributors in the food retail sector, has no retail outlet in Germany and faces competition of similar strength, it added.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
